   "text": "Construction~\\ref{common:marked-construction}, using $E'$ and requiring $de$ when $H_0$ is planar, therefore includes every possibility. The two choices of $E$ and the two cases for $H_0$ give $66{,}384$ candidates. Every resulting graph is toroidal, has a $K_5$ minor or a proper nontoroidal minor, or is isomorphic to one of thirteen graphs $\\mathfrak T_i$~\\supp{E30}. Nine have twin triples meeting in zero or two vertices, leaving $\\mathfrak T_{14},\\mathfrak T_{37},\\mathfrak T_{41},\\mathfrak T_{59}$."
